  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 94, width: 1200, height: 34 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568' }}>数据来自三个公开数据集，模型基于 YOLOv8n 官方预训练权重做迁移微调，并非从零训练。</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 140, width: 1200, height: 160, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 30 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 160, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据 A</Text></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>Kaggle / Roboflow</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>水果成熟度数据：苹果、香蕉、葡萄与腐烂类，CC BY 4.0。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 160, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 40, background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据 B</Text></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>草莓成熟度 v2</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>草莓高 / 中 / 低成熟，标注为多边形，需转换，CC BY 4.0。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: 380, height: 160, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #3D7BD9', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 40, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据 C</Text></Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>Fruits-360 Kaki</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8 }}>柿子样本但无成熟度标签，MIT 许可，需弱监督补齐。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 322, width: 1200, height: 84, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', textAlign: 'center' }}>模型基座：YOLOv8n 官方预训练权重 yolov8n.pt → 训练 8 轮 + 修正柿子框后微调 4 轮</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 430, width: 1200, height: 130, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 285, height: 130, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
