  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 588, width: 1200, height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>基础结论：合规开源数据（CC BY 4.0 / MIT）+ 预训练模型迁移微调 = 可复现的 16 类检测原型。</Text>
